<section class="section">
  <div class="section-label">The Process</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Three steps to your<br/><em>personal reading</em></h2>
  <p class="section-sub">No waiting. No back-and-forth. Just your details and a report that speaks to your exact life situation right now.</p>
  <div class="steps-grid">
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">01</span>
      <div class="step-icon">☽</div>
      <h3 class="step-title">Share Your Cosmic Identity</h3>
      <p class="step-desc">Enter your Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra — the three pillars of your Vedic birth chart. These form the soul of your personalised reading.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">02</span>
      <div class="step-icon">◎</div>
      <h3 class="step-title">Answer Four Guided Questions</h3>
      <p class="step-desc">Tell us your current struggles, daily rhythm, life goals, and spiritual orientation. Simple inputs that give our AI the context to speak to your life — not a generic horoscope.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">03</span>
      <div class="step-icon">↓</div>
      <h3 class="step-title">Download Your Full Report</h3>
      <p class="step-desc">Within minutes, receive a full Vedic guidance report. Download as PDF or Word, share with family, and revisit whenever you need clarity.</p>
